WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.120
feet at the same time together, moving those hands together, making sure that you're not

2
00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:10.780
dragging one foot behind the other.

3
00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:25.360
And we're already at a half way, you've got 20 seconds left, just keep it moving.

4
00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:30.960
We're almost done, just five seconds left till we switch to those jumping jacks.

5
00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:35.680
And switch it up, get those arms and legs moving, nice deep breath in, try to recover

6
00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:39.480
just a little bit with this, but keep those legs moving, keep those arms and legs nice

7
00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:51.280
and rigid, just keep moving and try to pump that lactic acid out of your system.

8
00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:54.820
Half way, keep those arms and legs moving, remember you get a nice long 20 second break

9
00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.660
after this, just keep it going.
